Package: OmicsQC
Type: Package
Title: Generic Omics Quality Control and Harmonization Pipeline
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Urmo Võsa, Andres Veidenberg
Maintainer: Andres Veidenberg <andres.veidenberg@gmail.com>
Description: Provides a lightweight quality control workflow for generic omics
    assay matrices. The package validates matrix format, calculates dataset,
    sample, and feature QC summaries, applies configurable sample and feature
    filters, supports optional PCA-based sample outlier removal and feature ID
    harmonization through linking files, and integrates validate rule files so
    project-specific checks can be added without changing code.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
Imports:
    validate
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
